{%- doc -%}
  The play glyph overlaid on a customer video in the PDP Redo customer photos
  strip. Purely decorative - the video is not click-to-play, it starts on the
  way into view - so it is hidden from assistive tech and fades out while the
  video is actually playing.
{%- enddoc -%}
<span class="pdp-redo-photos__play" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
    <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
  </svg>
</span>
